melonDS on GLES 3.2: the OpenGL renderer (2D, 3D and compositor) runs on a GLES context. Shaders compile as GLSL ES
3.20 (explicit float literals, a version/precision header and fragment output locations added by the loader), and the
DS's 1555 colours go up as 5_5_5_1 and come back through RGBA8 where GLES lacks GL_UNSIGNED_SHORT_1_5_5_5_REV. Desktop
GL is unchanged. Applied to cores/src/melondsds-deps/melonds-src (JesseTG/melonDS jtg/fix-uninitialized-opengl).

